    "A ghost lineage stops being resolvable as a distinct lineage below roughly 9 recovered segments. Above that it separates into its own mode, keeps most of its segments, and shows the carrier-geography enrichment that identifies its route; below it, the deep tail of the more common ghost swallows it entirely.",
